The best fit is a single **Composite API** call (`POST /services/data/v56.0/composite`). Setting `allOrNone: false` at the composite level means one failing sub-request never blocks the others, while setting `allOrNone: true` on each sub-request makes each order atomic (save-it-all-or-save-nothing). The `referenceId` on each sub-request provides the per-order identifier, and the `!$acct_xxx` syntax links the Opportunity to the Account upsert result from the same call.

