2. Create a DML finalizer that enqueues exactly one job per DML operation
3. Register both with the appropriate metadata records

The key insight is using `TriggerBase.waitToFinalize()` in the action to defer finalization until after all chunks of a DML operation complete, so the finalizer runs once with the full set of Ids. Two separate DML statements each trigger their own `nowFinalize()` cycle, producing separate jobs.

